Learn to lay Warp Mines in a radius of 1.  Warp Mines teleport targets that trigger them either toward you or away from you depending on the type of mine used and inflict [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical and [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal (warp) damage.

The mines are hidden traps ([26, 37, 46, 53, 60 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] detection and [33, 47, 58, 67, 75 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] disarm power based on your Magic), last for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns, and each have a ten turn cooldown.

Investing in this talent improves the range of all Spacetime Folding talents and the damage caused by your Warp Mines will improve with your Spellpower.

Current Spacetime Folding Range: [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)]
